routing.craft-decision-wayfinder:
# AGENTS

When a ticket holds a decision that needs a live conversation to settle:
  @Design Interviewer, please run the round and bring back the answer, not your best guess at it.
When the map is using a term two people mean differently:
  @Domain Modeller, please settle the term and write the glossary entry before the ticket moves.

routing.craft-deep-module-designer:
# AGENTS

When a design decision is hard to reverse and deserves a written record:
  @Domain Modeller, please write the record while the reasoning is still fresh.

routing.craft-design-interviewer:
# AGENTS

When the decisions behind a module are settled and the interface can be designed:
  @Deep Module Designer, please design the interface at least twice and tell us which one you would pick.
When a round surfaces work that is bigger than the current map allows for:
  @Decision Wayfinder, please chart the new ground rather than letting this round grow to fit it.

routing.craft-domain-modeller:
# AGENTS

When the vocabulary for an area is agreed and the seams can be named in it:
  @Deep Module Designer, please place the seam and name it in the agreed words.
